==Battleground==
*2 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
J.K. Bun Bun is 200% here, meaning you now need to use three braincells instead of two like other early Labyrinth stages. Anti-Red Labyrinth fodder with an anti-Red Uber should be fine here.

